  "description_snippet": "**VULNERABILITY DETAILS**   \nIn zlib a potential buffer overflow was fixed recently. See: https://github.com/madler/zlib/commit/eff308af425b67093bab25f80f1ae950166bece1  \nThe fix introduced a null pointer deref, which was fixed as well. See: https://github.com/madler/zlib/commit/1eb7682f845ac9e9bf9a"
